#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:88 ../../en/get-started/index.md:117
msgid "Run your first graph"
msgstr "运行第一个图"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:95 ../../en/get-started/index.md:117
msgid "Development mode"
msgstr "开发模式"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:7
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:10
msgid "Install and run"
msgstr "安装并运行"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Build Comfy Research from source, verify the local service, and then "
"complete a small CPU experiment."
msgstr "从源码构建 Comfy Research，验证本地服务，然后完成一个小型 CPU 实验。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:17
msgid ""
"The repository currently provides a source installation rather than a "
"prebuilt package. A first run needs Python, Node.js, and Git:"
msgstr "该仓库目前提供源码安装，而非预构建包。首次运行需要 Python、Node.js 和 Git："

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Requirement"
msgstr "要求"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Used for"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "3.10 or newer; docs CI uses 3.11"
msgstr "3.10 或更高版本；文档 CI 使用 3.11"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "FastAPI backend and research runtime"
msgstr "FastAPI 后端和研究运行时"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Node.js"
msgstr "Node.js"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Current LTS; Node 20 or newer recommended"
msgstr "当前 LTS；建议 Node 20 或更高版本"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "React/Vite frontend build"
msgstr "React/Vite 前端构建"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Git"
msgstr "Git"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Any maintained version"
msgstr "任一受维护版本"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:12
msgid "Source checkout and updates"
msgstr "源码检出与更新"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:26
msgid ""
"CPU is enough for the tutorial. CUDA, Apple MPS, and remote GPU execution "
"can be configured after the local path works."
msgstr "CPU 足以完成教程。本地路径正常后，可以配置 CUDA、Apple MPS 和远程 GPU 执行。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:29
msgid "Build from source"
msgstr "从源码构建"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:31
msgid "Clone the repository and enter it:"
msgstr "克隆仓库并进入目录："

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:38
msgid "Create an isolated Python environment and install the backend dependencies:"
msgstr "创建隔离的 Python 环境并安装后端依赖："

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:47
msgid "On Windows PowerShell, activate the environment with:"
msgstr "在 Windows PowerShell 中，使用以下命令激活环境："

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:53
msgid "Install the pinned frontend dependencies and build the static application:"
msgstr "安装锁定版本的前端依赖并构建静态应用："

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:60
msgid ""
"The frontend build also checks the generated Node metadata. If it reports a "
"mismatch, regenerate the checked-in Node artifacts before rebuilding."
msgstr "前端构建还会检查生成的 Node 元数据。若报告不匹配，请先重新生成已提交的 Node 产物，再重新构建。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:63
msgid "Start the application"
msgstr "启动应用"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:65
msgid "From the repository root, bind the first local run to the loopback interface:"
msgstr "从仓库根目录将首次本地运行绑定到回环接口："

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:71
msgid ""
"If the browser does not open, visit `http://127.0.0.1:8042/`. Keep this "
"terminal running while you use the application."
msgstr "若浏览器没有打开，请访问 `http://127.0.0.1:8042/`。使用应用期间请保持此终端运行。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:74
msgid "In a second terminal, verify the backend:"
msgstr "在第二个终端中验证后端："

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:80
msgid ""
"A successful response contains `\"ok\": true`. Fix startup or dependency "
"errors before creating a graph; the tutorial assumes this health check "
"passes."
msgstr "成功响应包含 `\"ok\": true`。创建图前请修复启动或依赖错误；本教程假定此健康检查已通过。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:92
msgid ""
"Load the bundled Edge of Stability (CPU) graph, run 80 CPU steps, and make "
"one controlled change."
msgstr "加载内置的 Edge of Stability (CPU) 图，在 CPU 上运行 80 步，并进行一次受控修改。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:99
msgid "Run the backend with the Vite frontend and return to a verified static build."
msgstr "使用 Vite 前端运行后端，然后回到已验证的静态构建。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:103
msgid "If startup fails"
msgstr "如果启动失败"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:105
msgid ""
"**The backend reports that `frontend/dist` is stale** : Run `npm --prefix "
"frontend run build`, then restart the server."
msgstr "**后端报告 `frontend/dist` 已过期**：运行 `npm --prefix frontend run build`，然后重启服务。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:108
msgid ""
"**Port 8042 is already in use** : Choose another port, such as 8842, in both"
" the start command and health URL."
msgstr "**端口 8042 已被占用**：在启动命令和健康检查 URL 中都选择另一个端口，例如 8842。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:111
msgid ""
"**A compute device is unavailable** : Use CPU for the first run. Configure "
"accelerators only after the local smoke   test succeeds."
msgstr "**计算设备不可用**：首次运行请使用 CPU。仅在本地 smoke test 成功后再配置加速器。"

#: ../../en/get-started/index.md:115
msgid ""
"For additional symptoms, see [Troubleshooting](../user-"
"guide/troubleshooting.md)."
msgstr "如有其他症状，请参阅[故障排查](../user-guide/troubleshooting.md)。"
